  "title": "Lab 24.5, part 1: get the lab, see what each file is, the recorded runs and the crew's settings, look before you run, the setup check (nothing to install), then look at each idea on its own with explore.py (the crew, one normal run, one hand-off, shared memory, the attack hop by hop, one poisoned hand-off, the trust boundaries, least privilege for two sends, a counter over the attack and a normal run, the adapted attack) and read the trace line by line",
